1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Believe me,
the rules' idea of continuation</b></font>

3
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:41,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is nothing but a cover
for the real plan.</b></font>

4
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:43,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mark my words.</b></font>

5
00:01:43,350 --> 00:01:45,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When only the strong remain,</b></font>

6
00:01:45,190 --> 00:01:48,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku is going to drop
a bomb on the game.</b></font>

7
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:51,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the Culling Game
will fulfill its real purpose.</b></font>

8
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:54,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know what kind of bomb
Kenjaku's going to drop,</b></font>

9
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:57,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it's going to happen
in the near future,</b></font>

10
00:01:57,790 --> 00:01:59,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's for sure.</b></font>

11
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:01,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe even this very moment.</b></font>

12
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:05,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why I'm preparing
by gathering strong allies</b></font>

13
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and stocking up points.</b></font>

14
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a few questions.</b></font>

15
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:13,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is she strong enough?
Because I have my doubts.</b></font>

16
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:14,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It doesn't matter
if she's strong</b></font>

17
00:02:14,930 --> 00:02:16,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because I'm just
using her as bait</b></font>

18
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:18,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to attract other players here.</b></font>

19
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:21,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People tend to be less wary
of women, you know.</b></font>

20
00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:23,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So when you're done using her,</b></font>

21
00:02:23,390 --> 00:02:25,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll just kill her
for the points?</b></font>

22
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know
what you're talking about.</b></font>

23
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd never do that.</b></font>

24
00:02:31,690 --> 00:02:34,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even though you're a bust,
Reggie's my actual true knight!</b></font>

25
00:02:34,990 --> 00:02:36,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As long as I serve him,</b></font>

26
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he'll protect me
from all danger!</b></font>

27
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How naive and stupid.</b></font>

28
00:02:40,830 --> 00:02:42,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you and your allies possess</b></font>

29
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:44,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at least 100 points
between all of you?</b></font>

30
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:47,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs] Most certainly.</b></font>

31
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:49,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
A new rule will be added soon.</b></font>

32
00:02:50,210 --> 00:02:53,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll allow players to transfer
points between each other.</b></font>

33
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hand over your points.
-[growls]</b></font>

34
00:02:56,590 --> 00:02:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need them for myself.</b></font>

35
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like negotiations
have broken down.</b></font>

36
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door creaks, slams]</b></font>

37
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

38
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:07,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[REGGIE] He's...
-[CHIZURU]...gone.</b></font>

39
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

40
00:03:09,610 --> 00:03:10,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHIZARU] Hey!</b></font>

41
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nue!</b></font>

42
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Reggie gasps]</b></font>

43
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:15,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Hey.</b></font>

44
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't let me
see your face again.</b></font>

45
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:20,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[Demon Dog whines]</b></font>

46
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:23,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Ah.</b></font>

47
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:26,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[groans]
-[REGGIE] I get it, I get it.</b></font>

48
00:03:26,830 --> 00:03:28,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought you were holding back,</b></font>

49
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:31,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but you can't kill us, can you?</b></font>

50
00:03:31,050 --> 00:03:33,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You want our points,
but only if we give them to you.</b></font>

51
00:03:34,210 --> 00:03:35,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I think</b></font>

52
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you fight
without trying to kill,</b></font>

53
00:03:38,390 --> 00:03:41,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll regret it the moment
you realize you're dead.</b></font>

54
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

55
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[loud crash]</b></font>

56
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Hey!</b></font>

57
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm down here, too, you know!</b></font>

58
00:04:09,330 --> 00:04:10,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He dead yet?</b></font>

59
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[coughs]</b></font>

60
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

61
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:17,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

62
00:04:19,090 --> 00:04:20,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You good with this?</b></font>

63
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This smell.</b></font>

64
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it over?</b></font>

65
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IORI] Not yet.</b></font>

66
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:43,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like you.</b></font>

67
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He ran into a room
before the explosion hit.</b></font>

68
00:04:47,410 --> 00:04:49,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh. Not bad at all.</b></font>

69
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:53,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good work.
I bet you wore him down a lot.</b></font>

70
00:04:54,670 --> 00:04:56,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[creaking, clanging]</b></font>

71
00:04:56,210 --> 00:04:58,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning softly]</b></font>

72
00:05:00,930 --> 00:05:02,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Do you finally get it?</b></font>

73
00:05:03,050 --> 00:05:05,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They have no intention
of protecting you.</b></font>

74
00:05:05,180 --> 00:05:07,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi groaning]</b></font>

75
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:08,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans softly]</b></font>

76
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now you know.</b></font>

77
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:11,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So get outta here.</b></font>

78
00:05:13,020 --> 00:05:14,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[thuds]
-[exclaims]</b></font>

79
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Give it a rest already.</b></font>

80
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] Then,</b></font>

81
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>say it.</b></font>

82
00:05:26,030 --> 00:05:28,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reggie said it
when I asked him to!</b></font>

83
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said he'd protect me!</b></font>

84
00:05:30,370 --> 00:05:32,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said he liked me!</b></font>

85
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you say it!</b></font>

86
00:05:37,210 --> 00:05:38,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh.</b></font>

87
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:41,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've seen them all.</b></font>

88
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Scumbags like you</b></font>

89
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:47,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who care more about words
than real action.</b></font>

90
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHIZURU]
That was a heck of a throw!</b></font>

91
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now you're all banged up.</b></font>

92
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wasn't easy
climbing back up here,</b></font>

93
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I made it.</b></font>

94
00:05:57,110 --> 00:05:59,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Use the stairs
next time, Neanderthal.</b></font>

95
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:02,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] Ding-dong, ding-dong,
ding-dong, ding-dong, ding-dong!</b></font>

96
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your attention please,
your attention.</b></font>

97
00:06:04,450 --> 00:06:07,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A player has added a new rule
to the Culling Game.</b></font>

98
00:06:08,410 --> 00:06:09,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rule Number Ten.</b></font>

99
00:06:09,830 --> 00:06:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Players are able to transfer</b></font>

100
00:06:11,330 --> 00:06:13,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a number of points
of their choosing</b></font>

101
00:06:13,250 --> 00:06:14,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to other players in the game.</b></font>

102
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHIZURU]
What kind of rule is that?</b></font>

103
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

104
00:06:25,470 --> 00:06:26,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sword clatters]</b></font>

105
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:29,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

106
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[croaks]</b></font>

107
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts, gasps]</b></font>

108
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[struggling grunts]</b></font>

109
00:06:38,610 --> 00:06:39,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[straining]</b></font>

110
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:43,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

111
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

112
00:06:48,490 --> 00:06:49,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

113
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Max Elephant!</b></font>

114
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

115
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:54,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[elephant trumpets]</b></font>

116
00:06:54,710 --> 00:06:55,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHIZURU] He did it again!</b></font>

117
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Nue screeches]</b></font>

118
00:07:00,210 --> 00:07:01,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

119
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

120
00:07:04,130 --> 00:07:05,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[loud crash]
-[bicycle bell rings]</b></font>

121
00:07:08,850 --> 00:07:10,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

122
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You bastard! How dare you?</b></font>

123
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[stabs]
-[groans]</b></font>

124
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:16,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[blood splatters]</b></font>

125
00:07:19,110 --> 00:07:20,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] What am I doing?</b></font>

126
00:07:22,650 --> 00:07:25,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll need more points
in the future,</b></font>

127
00:07:25,110 --> 00:07:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but Tsumiki won't be forced
to participate</b></font>

128
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the killing anymore.</b></font>

129
00:07:29,530 --> 00:07:30,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just be patient.</b></font>

130
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Believe in the others.</b></font>

131
00:07:32,540 --> 00:07:34,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't obsess
over these guys' points.</b></font>

132
00:07:35,290 --> 00:07:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All I need to do
is use my full might</b></font>

133
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to brush away any sparks
that might fall on me.</b></font>

134
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have gained five points
for a kill.</b></font>

135
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:46,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Man,
what a waste of points.</b></font>

136
00:07:47,090 --> 00:07:48,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How pathetic, getting killed</b></font>

137
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before he could
even use his technique.</b></font>

138
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Did Remi drop out?</b></font>

139
00:07:54,850 --> 00:07:56,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even so, it's still two on one.</b></font>

140
00:07:57,520 --> 00:08:00,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Damn it, I'm still reeling
from that first explosion.</b></font>

141
00:08:00,810 --> 00:08:02,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But fleeing ' s not an option.</b></font>

142
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe I should use my domain.</b></font>

143
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, bad idea.</b></font>

144
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:09,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's still incomplete.</b></font>

145
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no way
I can close the barrier</b></font>

146
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and trap them inside.</b></font>

147
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The worst outcome</b></font>

148
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would be them running off
and making me waste it.</b></font>

149
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

150
00:08:21,130 --> 00:08:23,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TAKABA] Look out!
-[explosion]</b></font>

151
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...out!
-[explosion]</b></font>

152
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...out!
-[explosion]</b></font>

153
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:28,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...out!
-[explosion]</b></font>

154
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Two on one, huh?</b></font>

155
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:36,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess in your books,</b></font>

156
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's what you consider
a fair fight?</b></font>

157
00:08:39,350 --> 00:08:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, not in mine.</b></font>

158
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:43,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where I'm from,</b></font>

159
00:08:43,270 --> 00:08:46,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>do you know what
they call people like you?</b></font>

160
00:08:46,190 --> 00:08:48,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They call them cowards!</b></font>

161
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And cowardly attacks
won't work on me!</b></font>

162
00:08:52,820 --> 00:08:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Behold!</b></font>

163
00:08:55,490 --> 00:08:59,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Zero damage!</b></font>

164
00:09:03,170 --> 00:09:04,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi groans]</b></font>

165
00:09:04,590 --> 00:09:05,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

166
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:10,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs, groans]</b></font>

167
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:27,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

168
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

169
00:09:37,370 --> 00:09:39,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

170
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Young boy, I can help you!</b></font>

171
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I turned 35 this year.</b></font>

172
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:52,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With one look at someone's face,</b></font>

173
00:09:52,590 --> 00:09:54,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can tell if they're
