174
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's wrong?</b></font>

175
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:02,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yucks! Anyone ever tell you
