176
00:10:02,350 --> 00:10:03,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi grumbles]</b></font>

177
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:04,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, well!</b></font>

178
00:10:04,770 --> 00:10:06,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I use a relative scale,</b></font>

179
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just like schools!</b></font>

180
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Schools use absolute scales.</b></font>

181
00:10:09,780 --> 00:10:11,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-He did protect me.
-[Takaba sniffs]</b></font>

182
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:13,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I guess
I can trust him for now.</b></font>

183
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, Hazenoki,</b></font>

184
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what do you make of him?</b></font>

185
00:10:17,330 --> 00:10:18,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know the guy.</b></font>

186
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:20,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's quicker just to ask him.</b></font>

187
00:10:20,450 --> 00:10:21,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey!
-[TAKABA] Hmm?</b></font>

188
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Type. Which are you?</b></font>

189
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:28,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts] Mm.</b></font>

190
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:30,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get it now.</b></font>

191
00:10:30,590 --> 00:10:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're asking what type
of comedian I am.</b></font>

192
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:34,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The type that's always funny?</b></font>

193
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:37,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or the ones
deluding themselves?</b></font>

194
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:38,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what
you're asking, right?</b></font>

195
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IORA] No, I'm asking what era--</b></font>

196
00:10:42,230 --> 00:10:45,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This costume is modeled
after my hero.</b></font>

197
00:10:45,230 --> 00:10:47,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The person who first
made me laugh my guts out</b></font>

198
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I was a child!</b></font>

199
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:51,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So to honor this costume,</b></font>

200
00:10:52,070 --> 00:10:54,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I cannot allow my jokes
