00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind whistling]</b></font>

208
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What a shitty audience!</b></font>

209
00:11:26,730 --> 00:11:28,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were always jerks like you!</b></font>

210
00:11:28,310 --> 00:11:30,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People who forget
