226
00:12:12,770 --> 00:12:13,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

227
00:12:16,700 --> 00:12:18,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's you and I take
