231
00:12:25,250 --> 00:12:26,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm, hmm, hmm, hmm, hmm!</b></font>

232
00:12:26,330 --> 00:12:27,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Dude!
