237
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:42,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back down, and I'll let you go.</b></font>

238
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

239
00:12:45,350 --> 00:12:47,230
