00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:09,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[epic duel music playing]</b></font>

251
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:15,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am an entertainer.</b></font>

252
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:18,470
