261
00:13:45,990 --> 00:13:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

262
00:13:49,290 --> 00:13:50,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where'd he...</b></font>

263
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:54,630
