264
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:55,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

265
00:13:58,340 --> 00:14:00,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

266
00:14:00,050 --> 00:14:01,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not funny!</b></font>

267
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:09,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad you aren't
