269
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:16,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Later, young boy!</b></font>

270
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:17,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Try not to die.</b></font>

271
00:14:18,780 --> 00:14:20,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aww.</b></font>

272
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:22,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that guy's dead too.</b></font>

273
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After that humiliation,</b></font>

274
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:25,780
