276
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I warned you.</b></font>

277
00:14:29,490 --> 00:14:32,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like I said, I've achieved
