278
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:33,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So no more holding back.</b></font>

279
00:14:33,910 --> 00:14:35,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can fight for real now.</b></font>

280
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

281
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Nue screeches]</b></font>

282
00:14:44,090 --> 00:14:45,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Reggie panting]</b></font>

283
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

284
00:14:58,940 --> 00:15:00,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

285
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,830
