<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Woo-hoo! Yeah!</b></font>

290
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:50,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

291
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:08,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

292
00:16:08,590 --> 00:16:10,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

293
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:16,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

294
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:18,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

295
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

296
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:54,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] You've figured out
