300
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:10,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
You're absolutely correct.</b></font>

301
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's hard to describe,</b></font>

302
00:17:12,530 --> 00:17:15,740
