322
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why
you can't use your dog</b></font>

323
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to run, attack, and defend.</b></font>

324
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And because of that,</b></font>

325
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you've been forced
to use multiple</b></font>

326
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:19,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>one-trick shikigami all at once.</b></font>

327
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:20,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a battle of attrition</b></font>

328
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:23,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where neither of us can use
big, high-output moves.</b></font>

329
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you see it's futile?</b></font>

330
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:27,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no way you can kill me.</b></font>

331
00:18:29,690 --> 00:18:30,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's true.</b></font>

332
00:18:31,030 --> 00:18:32,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I'll run.</b></font>

333
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:34,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait.</b></font>

334
00:18:34,990 --> 00:18:36,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Nue screeches]</b></font>

335
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:44,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
It won't be that easy.</b></font>

336
00:18:47,250 --> 00:18:48,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scooter whirring]</b></font>

337
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:53,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[humming]</b></font>

338
00:18:56,340 --> 00:18:58,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A community gymnasium?</b></font>

339
00:18:58,260 --> 00:18:59,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he flee inside?</b></font>

340
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:01,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or is he luring me in?</b></font>

341
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:03,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could smoke him out
with fire,</b></font>

342
00:19:03,430 --> 00:19:06,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but getting into another chase
would be annoying.</b></font>

343
00:19:06,230 --> 00:19:09,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, whatever shall I do?</b></font>

344
00:19:11,230 --> 00:19:12,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Good.</b></font>

345
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:14,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just as I imagined.</b></font>

346
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:15,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the perfect size.</b></font>

347
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:19,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder what you have
planned for me in here,</b></font>

348
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:21,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you damned little punk.</b></font>

349
00:19:22,910 --> 00:19:26,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have something planned
yourself, don't you?</b></font>

350
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:33,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All sorcerers tend
to tell lies now and then.</b></font>

351
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

352
00:19:39,430 --> 00:19:40,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

353
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:47,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[thuds]
-[groans]</b></font>

354
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:50,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

355
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[winces]</b></font>

356
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:55,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sword clangs]</b></font>

357
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

358
00:20:10,540 --> 00:20:12,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

359
00:20:12,170 --> 00:20:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

360
00:20:15,670 --> 00:20:17,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

361
00:20:17,130 --> 00:20:18,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps, groans]</b></font>

362
00:20:25,890 --> 00:20:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[pants]</b></font>

363
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

364
00:20:29,650 --> 00:20:31,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] The things
I recreate from receipts</b></font>

365
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are like shikigami.</b></font>

366
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I can give them simple
commands to get what I want.</b></font>

367
00:20:36,570 --> 00:20:39,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Knives normally don't fly,
but that one sure did.</b></font>

368
00:20:40,410 --> 00:20:43,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Given your personality,
I think you're going to say no.</b></font>

369
00:20:43,370 --> 00:20:44,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if you transfer
your points to me,</b></font>

370
00:20:44,910 --> 00:20:47,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise I will give you
a quick and easy death</b></font>

371
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:51,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Barrier techniques
are difficult, aren't they?</b></font>

372
00:20:53,250 --> 00:20:55,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter how long I've tried,</b></font>

373
00:20:55,210 --> 00:20:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't been able
to get the hang of placing</b></font>

374
00:20:57,260 --> 00:21:00,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>an artificial space
of different size over reality.</b></font>

375
00:21:00,470 --> 00:21:01,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which is why...</b></font>

376
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:04,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] No way.</b></font>

377
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:08,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I'm going
to use this gymnasium as is</b></font>

378
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to deploy my domain.</b></font>

379
00:21:11,650 --> 00:21:13,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] He can do that?</b></font>

380
00:21:33,330 --> 00:21:35,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Domain Expansion.</b></font>

381
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:38,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Chimera Shadow Garden.</b></font>

382
00:21:38,670 --> 00:21:40,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thudding, beeping]</b></font>

383
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:47,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] I didn't know he was
a sorcerer on that level.</b></font>

384
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I never said</b></font>

385
00:21:49,980 --> 00:21:52,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't have any big moves.</b></font>

386
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:57,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

387
00:23:25,820 --> 00:23:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Even incomplete,
a domain is still a domain!</b></font>

388
00:23:28,620 --> 00:23:31,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] I'm pulling out
my trump card and activating it!</b></font>

389
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Not yet!
Endure a little longer!</b></font>

390
00:23:32,700 --> 00:23:34,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
I acknowledge your strength.</b></font>

391
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:35,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Which of us
will get crushed first?</b></font>

392
00:23:35,870 --> 00:23:38,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Get crushed!</b></font>

